{"id":2721,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div><p>在85周年校庆之际，为着力培养研究生学术素养、提升科研创新与综合发展能力，我院于5月15日在科艺苑学术报告厅举办华彩讲坛。本次讲座由院党委副书记李庆乐主持，山西师范大学马克思主义学院党委书记乔瑞教授主讲，学院师生参加。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WolMH2MNU8MRQfngzUZLRW7M46RLlQLVM7CYM7MfLmNbL4G0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybUYyiLky4MmMfM47sM4UPozCYnmAkUmv8nlCiMRr2UzTFMNU4U8Q7MlQFLmVfU8LJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaLzlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7015&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/D9C50363A717741962F8BB74EF545FA9/6D3CFD5F/21ACC\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"693\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WolMH2MNU8MRQfngzUZLRW7M46RLlQLVM7CYM7MfLmNbL4G0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybUYyiLky4MmMfM47sM4UPozCYnmAkUmv8nlCiMRr2UzTFMNU4U8Q7MlQFLmVfU8LJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaLzlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7015&e=.jpg\"></p><p>乔教授从报考初心、跨学科优势、实践能力培养、情绪管理四个方面分享经验。她指出跨学科能够拓宽认知视野、融合多元思维，为学术研究与论文写作提供多元分析视角。同时建议同学们主动参与学生工作、策划项目、申报科研课题，在实践中锤炼协调沟通与科研写作能力，并提醒大家学会调节科研压力、稳住心态、潜心治学。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Wn7LH8olCbM7CbLg8LYMmG4Lz9iMmCLDollDozvaL4UDUm70gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2L1y4M1yinz7YM7l8MRUbUml4Mm67L7-DMz7iL4UbL7WFUlWRU4lsLmMFLllDUNlJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaLzlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7015&e=.jpg\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/2F2365E124E4449B5367D0B65153490B/ABCC5723/1E6BE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"693\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Wn7LH8olCbM7CbLg8LYMmG4Lz9iMmCLDollDozvaL4UDUm70gihFp2hmCIa0L1h2L1y4M1yinz7YM7l8MRUbUml4Mm67L7-DMz7iL4UbL7WFUlWRU4lsLmMFLllDUNlJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaLzlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7015&e=.jpg\"></p><p>本次讲座内容充实、指导性强，有效助力我院师生明晰学术路径、提升科研素养，作为校庆学术系列活动，也为建校85周年营造了优良学术风尚。</p></div></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://mkszyxy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=WolMH2MNU8MRQfngzUZLRW7M46RLlQLVM7CYM7MfLmNbL4G0gihFp2hmCIa0nkybUYyiLky4MmMfM47sM4UPozCYnmAkUmv8nlCiMRr2UzTFMNU4U8Q7MlQFLmVfU8LJqjfjo4OeoDiAvjAXvD80qIbtpYyPLRGYg4vaLzlJqdMnx&oid=1579047909&tid=1002&nid=7015&e=.jpg"}